&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Azure and Kubernetes, with hands-on experience in managing and deploying applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
