&lt;p&gt;Experience with monitoring tools such as NewRelic or Splunk for effective system monitoring and alerting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
