&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5780&quot; data-local-id=&quot;75ae73655bf8&quot;&gt;Experience working with cloud-based infrastructure and technologies, preferably AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
