&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5868&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ad03c5011e5&quot;&gt;Understanding of DevOps concepts such as containers (e.g., Docker), orchestration (e.g., Kubernetes), and Infrastructure as Code (e.g., CloudFormation or Terraform).&lt;/p&gt;
