&lt;p data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;Deep Technical Investigation (Primary Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;1166&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;Lead root cause analysis beyond L2 depth (GPU failures, firmware issues, Linux-level faults, HW/SW interactions).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;Detect recurring patterns across sites and convert findings into durable fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1166&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1166&quot;&gt;Own technical workstreams during high-severity incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
