&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-6aa02ea2-6370-83ed-968f-5102ede4f937-129&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-6aa02ea2-6370-83ed-968f-5102ede4f937-129&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-160&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;Join a French foodtech superstar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re changing the way people in France eat and cook with our meal kits!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambition? To revolutionize our subscribers’ everyday lives by promoting a more sustainable way of cooking while helping them discover delicious, creative and balanced recipes. The perfect combination of technology and gastronomy, for maximum enjoyment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh operates in more than 15 countries. France is a young market, launched in 2019, and has experienced tremendous growth: we have already been the market leader since 2021. It’s the perfect time to join our team and make a real impact in one of France’s most promising scale-ups!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we make all this possible? Through a talented and dynamic team, strong values centered around kindness and diversity, and an inspiring and stimulating work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2023, we opened a production site in France. If you’d like to be part of this incredible human, international and entrepreneurial adventure, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Junior Supply Chain Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll help ensure our production always receives the right ingredients and materials on time, in full, and with the required quality. You&#39;ll be the main point of contact for suppliers whenever deliveries don&#39;t go as planned and work closely with internal teams to find quick and effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines communication, coordination, and data analysis. You&#39;ll investigate issues, identify root causes, and support continuous process improvements. Your work has a direct impact on ensuring our customers receive their HelloFresh boxes exactly as expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor inbound deliveries and ensure production is supplied on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for suppliers regarding delivery delays, shortages, or quality deviations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead confident and solution-oriented conversations with suppliers, following up until issues are resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Procurement, Production, Warehouse, FSQA, and Operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse delivery issues and perform root cause analyses to identify improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare reports and communicate insights clearly to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support continuous improvement initiatives across our supply chain processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce food waste while maintaining excellent supplier performance and service levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Supply Chain Management, Logistics, Business Administration, or a related field, or an equivalent qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First practical experience through internships, working student positions, or an entry-level role in Supply Chain, Logistics, or Manufacturing is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both &lt;strong&gt;French and English (minimum B2 level)&lt;/strong&gt;, as you&#39;ll communicate daily with suppliers and internal stakeholders in both languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the confidence to manage challenging supplier conversations professionally and assertively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured way of working with the ability to prioritise tasks and stay calm under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset with&amp;nbsp; experience using Excel or Google Sheets. Experience with ERP, WMS, or BI tools is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The days off are Monday and Sunday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;fully onsite position&lt;/strong&gt; at our production site. Remote work is not available for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work weekends when required is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
